            "editorLayout": "threeVideosWithText"
          },
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "<p>Machine knitters can do SO MUCH with our machines.  Here's an intro to a couple of fun things.<br></p>\n\n<p>Promise me you won't get carried away (and distracted) just yet.  We still need to concentrate on some basics! <i class=\"fa fa-smile-o aria-hidden=\" true\"=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></p>",
