            {
              "type": "video",
              "vimeoId": "319202520",
              "title": "Ease, Build your Pattern and Knitting",
              "legacyComponentId": 4517,
              "order": 2
            }
          ],
          "title": "Basic Beginner Hat",
          "slug": "basic-beginner-hat",
          "order": 1,
          "legacy": {
            "assignId": 3314,
            "blockType": "VimeoID"
          }
        },
        {
          "title": "Knit it Now Hat pattern",
          "slug": "content-1782561100507",
          "order": 3,
          "legacy": {
            "assignId": 3318,
            "blockType": "HTML"
          },
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "<h3>Ready to Practice?</h3>\n\n<p>Now that you understand gauge and tension, put your new skills to work by knitting a simple hat.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The Hat Pattern Builder will help you create a custom pattern based on your machine, gauge, and measurements.</p><p>Enter YOUR gauge, choose your size - answer a couple of questions and build your hat!</p><p><br></p><p><br></p>\n\n<a href=\"/patterns/hat/builder\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Build Your Custom Pattern</a>\n\n",
              "legacyComponentId": 8521,
              "order": 3
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Hems and Ribbing",
      "slug": "hems-and-ribbing",
      "displayOrder": 10,
      "legacy": {
        "itemId": 234,
        "lessonOrder": 10
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "title": "Hems",
          "slug": "text-image-1782561614195",
          "order": 1,
          "legacy": {
            "assignId": 3302,
            "blockType": "HTML",
            "editorLayout": "textImage"
          },
          "layoutOptions": {
            "imagePosition": "right",
            "header": null
          },
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "For most knitting projects a plain 'ol cast just isn't enough.\nHems are a beautiful way to start (and end) your knitting.\n<ul>\n<li>Scrap and Ravel</li>\n<li>E-Wrap</li>\n<li>Every Other Needle</li>\n</ul>\n<div class='text-center'> <a href=\"/downloads/hem_exercises3.pdf\" class=\"kbm-btn kbm-btn-primary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download Hem Exercises</a>\n",
              "legacyComponentId": 8522,
              "order": 1,
              "layoutRole": "textImageText"
            },
            {
              "type": "image",
              "src": "/images/courses/hems.webp",
              "alt": "machine knitted hems",
              "caption": "Finish beautiful hems",
              "legacyComponentId": 8523,
              "order": 2,
              "layoutRole": "textImageImage"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Ribbing",
          "slug": "three-videos-1782562311331",
          "order": 3,
          "legacy": {
            "assignId": 3303,
            "blockType": "HTML",
            "editorLayout": "threeVideosWithText"
          },
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "<p>\n  No matter what machine you have, you can add ribbing to your knitting. Examine and try whatever method works for you.\n</p>\n<div class='text-center'><a href=\"/downloads/page112.pdf\" class=\"kbm-btn kbm-btn-primary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download Ribbing Worksheet</a>",
