      "blocks": [
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "<ul>\n<li>Stockinette</li>\n<li>Tuck</li>\n<li>Slip</li>\n<li>Fairisle (stranded knitting)</li>\n<li>Lace</li>\n</ul>\n<br>\n<em>Learning to work stitch patterns is outside the scope of this course, this is just an introduction to the possibilities of your machine (no matter what machine you have).</em>",
