              "type": "richText",
              "html": "\n<div style=\"\n    display:flex;\n    gap:2rem;\n    align-items:flex-start;\n    flex-wrap:wrap;\n    margin:1.5rem 0;\n\">\n    <div style=\"flex:1;\">\n  Unless you only want to knit blankets and scarves, increasing and decreasing is top on your list of skills to master.<br><br>\n\n<a href=\"/downloads/page121.pdf\" class=\"kbm-btn kbm-btn-primary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Print Shaping Worksheet</a>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"width:40%; min-width:250px;\">\n        <img src=\"/challenge/images/v2/33/trust_know_practice.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; display:block;\">\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n",
